# Named one by one, not by pattern: cq c stages the whole tree, so anything
# missing from this file goes into the next commit. A Go binary is ELF and
# the collection's audit rejects it.
/yamlc
/yamlc-mut
/scratch/
t/corpus/
t/tmp/
__pycache__/
# go test -fuzz writes a failing input here; the ones worth keeping are
# f.Add seeds in fuzz_test.go instead, where they can carry a comment.
testdata/
